#: luci-app-sbproxy/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/sbproxy/client.js:1883
msgid ""
"Select a bridge to bypass all its members, or select individual wired ports. "
"Prefer the WiFi selector for wireless networks. This overrides proxy rules "
"for the selected incoming traffic, but does not disable upstream-router "
"proxies."
msgstr ""
"选择网桥会让其所有成员绕过代理，也可以单独选择有线端口。无线网络优先使用 "
"WiFi 选择器。选中来源的流量不再执行代理规则，但不会关闭上级路由器的代理。"

#: luci-app-sbproxy/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/sbproxy/core.js:235
msgid ""
"Select a published SBProxy core version to upgrade, reinstall or roll back. "
"Historical versions are downloaded from GitHub; no local rollback backup is "
"required."
msgstr ""
"选择已发布的 SBProxy 核心版本进行升级、重装或回滚。历史版本从 GitHub 下载，无"
"需预先保存本地回滚备份。"

#: luci-app-sbproxy/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/sbproxy/core.js:333
msgid ""
"Select an older version above to roll back from GitHub. Before switching, an "
"emergency recovery package is downloaded so a failed core can be restored "
"without network access. Incompatible configurations block installation."
msgstr ""
"在上方选择旧版本即可从 GitHub 下载并回滚。切换前会下载应急恢复包，确保新核心"
"失败后可在断网时恢复。配置不兼容时将阻止安装。"

#: luci-app-sbproxy/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/sbproxy/tailscale.js:625
msgid "Select an online Tailscale exit node."
msgstr "选择一个在线的 Tailscale 出口节点。"

#: luci-app-sbproxy/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/sbproxy/tailscale.js:569
msgid ""
"Select local interface subnets to publish. Custom CIDR values remain "
"supported."
msgstr "选择要发布的本地接口子网。仍支持自定义 CIDR 值。"

#: luci-app-sbproxy/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/sbproxy/tailscale.js:515
msgid ""
"Select subnets advertised by peers after login. Custom CIDR values remain "
"supported."
msgstr "登录后选择对端发布的子网。仍支持自定义 CIDR 值。"

#: luci-app-sbproxy/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/sbproxy/client.js:1893
msgid ""
"Selected sources use direct upstream DNS for ordinary port-53 queries; local "
"names and reverse lookups remain with dnsmasq. Existing or hardware-"
"accelerated connections may keep their previous path: reconnect clients "
"after changing policy. Disabling this option removes only SBProxy ingress "
"rules."
msgstr ""
"选中来源的普通 53 端口 DNS 查询使用直连上游解析，局域网名称及反向解析仍由 "
"dnsmasq 处理。已建立或硬件加速的连接可能沿用原路径，修改策略后请让客户端重新"
"连接。关闭此功能仅清理 SBProxy 的接入策略规则。"

#: luci-app-sbproxy/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/sbproxy/client.js:1833
msgid ""
"Separate from the custom-routing download outbound. Only rule sets "
"referenced by enabled diversion groups are loaded in mainland mode."
msgstr ""
"与自定义路由的下载出站分开保存。大陆白名单模式只加载已启用分流组引用的规则"
"集。"

#: luci-app-sbproxy/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/sbproxy/client.js:555
msgid "Serve expired DNS entries while refreshing them in the background."
msgstr "刷新期间提供已过期的 DNS 条目。"

#: luci-app-sbproxy/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/sbproxy/client.js:488
msgid ""
"Serve the dashboard with a certificate issued for this device by Tailscale. "
"Embedded Tailscale and HTTPS certificates in the Tailnet DNS settings must "
"be enabled, and the dashboard must be opened with the device MagicDNS name."
msgstr ""
"使用 Tailscale 为此设备签发的证书提供仪表盘服务。必须启用内置 Tailscale 和 "
"Tailnet DNS 设置中的 HTTPS 证书，并通过设备的 MagicDNS 名称打开仪表盘。"

