msgid "Use a unique random secret of at least 16 characters. Dashboard access is restricted to LAN and explicitly allowed Tailscale interfaces, even when WAN input is allowed."
msgstr "请使用至少 16 个字符的独立随机密钥。面板仅允许 LAN 及显式授权的 Tailscale 接口访问，即使 WAN 入站策略为放行也不会暴露面板。"

msgid "Set an API secret of at least 16 characters when the dashboard is enabled."
msgstr "启用面板时，请设置至少 16 个字符的 API 密钥。"

msgid "Preparing the core operation..."
msgstr "正在准备核心操作…"

msgid "Querying published core packages..."
msgstr "正在查询已发布的核心软件包…"

msgid "Downloading the selected core package..."
msgstr "正在下载所选核心软件包…"

msgid "Verifying the package and current configuration..."
msgstr "正在校验软件包和当前配置…"

msgid "Preparing the emergency recovery package..."
msgstr "正在准备应急恢复包…"

msgid "Installing the core package..."
msgstr "正在安装核心软件包…"

msgid "Restarting SBProxy; network access may pause briefly..."
msgstr "正在重启 SBProxy，网络可能短暂中断…"

msgid "Checking core process and listener stability..."
msgstr "正在检查核心进程及监听端口的稳定性…"

msgid "Restoring the previous core..."
msgstr "正在恢复先前的核心…"

msgid "The operation result cannot be confirmed yet. This does not mean the upgrade failed. Reconnect to the router and check again; do not repeat the installation or power off the router."
msgstr "暂时无法确认操作结果，这不代表升级失败。请重新连接路由器后再次查询，不要重复安装或关闭路由器电源。"

msgid "Check operation status"
msgstr "查询操作状态"

msgid "Completed"
msgstr "已完成"

msgid "Result unconfirmed"
msgstr "结果未确认"

msgid "Last core operation: %s — %s"
msgstr "最近一次核心操作：%s — %s"

msgid "Core operation progress"
msgstr "核心操作进度"

msgid "View operation"
msgstr "查看操作"

msgid "Reading operation status..."
msgstr "正在读取操作状态…"

msgid "The operation runs on the router. Closing this dialog or refreshing the page does not cancel it. Do not power off the router."
msgstr "操作在路由器后台执行，关闭此弹窗或刷新页面不会取消操作。请勿关闭路由器电源。"

msgid "Connection interrupted. Waiting for the router to reconnect; the core operation may still be running..."
msgstr "连接暂时中断，正在等待路由器恢复连接；核心操作可能仍在后台进行…"

msgid "Off"
msgstr "关闭"

msgid "Proxy disabled"
msgstr "代理已关闭"

msgid "Disable proxy traffic handling without stopping enabled Tailscale or server services. Saved nodes and routing rules are retained."
msgstr "关闭代理流量接管，不停止已启用的 Tailscale 或服务端。保留已选节点和路由规则。"

msgid "Disable is retained for compatibility. Use Proxy mode to turn the proxy off while keeping the selected node."
msgstr "保留“禁用”以兼容旧配置。建议通过“代理模式”关闭代理，这样可以保留已选节点。"

msgid "Smart node selection"
msgstr "智能选节点"

msgid "Evaluate multiple HTTPS targets, reliability and jitter every 60 seconds. Switch after sustained improvement, or repeated failures."
msgstr "每 60 秒综合检测多个 HTTPS 目标的可用性、延迟和波动。持续明显更优或当前节点连续失败时切换。"

msgid "Measure download performance"
msgstr "检测下载表现"

msgid "Download up to 256 KiB per candidate for the best three candidates every 10 minutes. Uses about 108 MiB per day per group at most, excluding connection overhead."
msgstr "每 10 分钟为排名靠前的最多三个候选节点各下载至多 256 KiB。每组每天最多约 108 MiB，不含连接开销。"

msgid "URLTest interval"
msgstr "URLTest 检测间隔"

msgid "URLTest interval in seconds (default: 60). Smart selection uses its own 60-second cycle; large groups may take longer."
msgstr "URLTest 检测间隔，单位为秒，默认 60。智能选节点使用独立的 60 秒检测周期，候选节点较多时可能延长。"

msgid "The test tolerance in milliseconds (default: 75)."
msgstr "切换容差，单位为毫秒，默认 75。"

msgid "Smart selection: %s"
msgstr "智能选节点：%s"
